n 1995 y Estados Unidos en 2007. Y evitó una catástrofe nuclear en 2013 en la última película.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1801486","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:33.225Z"},{"id":"movie-1495114","slug":"movie-1495114","title":"Mermaid Beach","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1VD9jPmGUkaEQg8h2OI70KApYEr.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando Lily y su familia se mudan a una nueva ciudad junto al mar, le resulta difícil instalarse, pero luego un descubrimiento mágico en la playa cambia su vida para siempre mientras encuentra el coraje para proteger lo que más importa.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1495114","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:33.526Z"},{"id":"movie-1422822","slug":"movie-1422822","title":"It's a മെഡിക്കൽ മിറാക്കിള്‍","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tT9VKxtyyb5uFsxZhdnvE1GVZJd.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1422822","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:33.830Z"},{"id":"movie-1291608","slug":"movie-1291608","title":"Patriotismo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kOLkpkS2T4HAdA6J7uq4eipNTup.jpg","synopsis":"A principios de los 2000, un operativo encubierto se infiltra en el submundo de Karachi para desmantelar una violenta red criminal.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1291608","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:34.131Z"},{"id":"movie-1738575","slug":"movie-1738575","title":"She Stole My Son's Heart","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5FsDc9RpSz9KfxX8SkXbX2Pwmqe.jpg","synopsis":n