de 150 años de historia enterrada, enfrentándose a la impactante y fundamental verdad del propio Ōoku. Acorralado por un dios alimentado por siglos de sacrificio y furia, el Vendedor de Medicinas afronta su mayor crisis, donde está en juego el alma misma de la nación. Secuela de la película \"Mononoke II: Las cenizas de la ira\".","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Fantasía","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1322562","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:37.158Z"},{"id":"movie-863149","slug":"movie-863149","title":"하트맨","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eBZMZKXuH0ir3pGd7wFx31IHmk8.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia","Música"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/863149","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:37.469Z"},{"id":"movie-803796","slug":"movie-803796","title":"Las guerreras k-pop","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6EQMqEmdG5HoGe2zT1WwWUMvVhv.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando no están llenando estadios, las superestrellas del K-pop Rumi, Mira y Zoey usan sus poderes secretos para proteger a sus fans de una amenaza sobrenatural.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Música","Comedia","Animación"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/803796","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:37.770Z"},{"id":"movie-1757174","slug":"movie-1757174","title":"Bara till jul","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9kHrUoPF2rl5Hj0QMquAy3xznXT.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1757174","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:38.074Z"},{"id":"movie-1586876","slug":"movie-1586876","title":"映画ちいかわ 人魚の島のひみつ","image":"https