 Totoros, dioses de la selva. Poco después, reciben noticias desde el hospital de que su madre no puede venir a casa como había prometido, por lo que Mei (la más joven) se escapa para ir a visitarla. Satsuki tiene que recurrir a un Totoro para ayudar a encontrarla.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Animación","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/8392","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1988,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:41.785Z"},{"id":"movie-1590613","slug":"movie-1590613","title":"Cerita Lila","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/80CcJdrV3ewqPawFMAFGIrldgR5.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1590613","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:42.086Z"},{"id":"movie-1282777","slug":"movie-1282777","title":"Creature Fear","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bZDvdrvUGl3OIH1wc0GjyludKkO.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1282777","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:42.389Z"},{"id":"movie-1424965","slug":"movie-1424965","title":"Infierno bajo cero","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dQyyx00wZSiJlJEAT0oIo9NZVjn.jpg","synopsis":"Atrapada en una placa de hielo a la deriva en el Ártico, una patinadora artística lucha por sobrevivir mientras el hielo se fragmenta y la arrastra hacia aguas abiertas. Sin posibilidad de rescate, cada minuto es una batalla contra el frío extremo, el hambre y el agotamiento.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1424965","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:42.692Z"},{"id":"movie-493922","slug":"movie-493922","title":"Hereditary","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oE5TS72U6tNdXKK42HpF2NULv4u.jpg","synopsis":"Cosas extrañas comienzan a suceder en casa de los Graham tras la muerte de la abuela y matriarca, que deja en herencia su casa a su hija Annie. Annie Graham, una galerista casada y con dos hijos, no tuvo una infancia demasiado feliz junto a su madre, y cree que la muerte de ésta puede hacer que pase página. Pero todo se complica cuando su hija menor comienza a ver figuras fantasmales, que también empiezan a aparecer ante su hermano.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Misterio","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/493922","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2018,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:42.991Z"},{"id":"movie-1744346","slug":"movie-1744346","title":"Superthings: La película","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ncJXMB0MbDiXIpqCdNSN4MYRe3k.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Acción","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1744346","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:43.290Z"},{"id":"movie-829487","slug":"movie-829487","title":"Me llamo Agneta","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4D2Mj3oyCx9PsYl8GPv0O0rIprt.jpg","synopsis":"En busca de un nuevo comienzo, Agneta, desempleada, acepta un trabajo como ‘au pair’ en la Provenza que acaba convirtiéndose en una escapada y un despertar inesperado.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/829487","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:10:43.592Z"},{"id":"movie-1631506","slug":"movie-1631506","title":"La ahorcada","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJG3aJsul9dgiN5j8BtCNU6I9QV.jpg","synopsis":"Rosa Martín, cantautora conocida como \"La Ahorcada\", se suicida en el jardín de Fran, un hombre al que amaba y que la trataba