hhEY0UUycS.jpg","synopsis":"Fujino, una chica popular y extrovertida, es aclamada por sus compañeros de clase por sus cómics divertidos en el periódico de la clase. Un día, su profesora le pide que comparta el espacio con Kyomoto, un recluso que se ausenta de la escuela y cuyas hermosas obras de arte despiertan en ella un fervor competitivo. Lo que comienza como celos se transforma cuando Fujino se da cuenta de su pasión compartida por el dibujo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1244492","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:11:02.601Z"},{"id":"movie-1545621","slug":"movie-1545621","title":"Detective Conan 29: El ángel caído de la carretera","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5pEcrCTuocLsHeLKCE4zRgmmkOK.jpg","synopsis":"Edogawa Conan y Chihaya Hagiwara deben unirse para identificar al conductor de la misteriosa motocicleta completamente negra que causó el caos en Kanagawa.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Animación","Misterio","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545621","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:11:02.901Z"},{"id":"movie-1658840","slug":"movie-1658840","title":"Родичі","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jI6Ko8ET4P3PpnBZ1Eyq3D3l4fb.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1658840","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:11:03.227Z"},{"id":"movie-1466123","slug":"movie-1466123","title":"L'Objet du délit","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e2mlHslGi272nXgiD3ekvdfYx5y.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama","Música"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1466123","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":