mdb.org/t/p/w300/7eZUL4fvjVkmNPbD8IxQT4X9emt.jpg","synopsis":"Los Drs. Venkman, Stantz y Epengler, son tres doctores en parapsicología que se quedan sin empleo tras quedar excluidos de una beca universitaria de investigación. Entonces deciden formar la empresa Cazafantasmas, dedicada a limpiar Nueva York de ectoplasmas. El aumento repentino de apariciones espectrales en la Gran Manzana será el presagio de la llegada de un peligroso y poderoso demonio.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/620","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1984,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:12.668Z"},{"id":"movie-1537617","slug":"movie-1537617","title":"Frankie, Maniac Woman","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6EgLObKSdWIWZGRVVTsf4VNzoBc.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1537617","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:12.990Z"},{"id":"movie-1800090","slug":"movie-1800090","title":"Geheime Krieger KSK – Die Eliteeinheit der Bundeswehr","image":null,"synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1800090","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:13.298Z"},{"id":"movie-1378791","slug":"movie-1378791","title":"Everybody Digs Bill Evans","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zXZel9xntywX8PV7GgeP5fRYH33.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Música"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1378791","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:13.595Z"},{"id":"movie-1239481","slug":"movie-1239481","title":"Raqa","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xB40gvmC7c3XuIeITCs8ylmjHHH.jpg","synopsis":"En las peligrosas calles de Raqa, el espía internacional, Haibala (alias El Saharaui), intenta dar caza a El Jordano, uno de los jefes del ISIS más buscados del momento. No es el único infiltrado en Siria. Malika, una enfermera de Ceuta al servicio de la Europol, ha llegado a Raqa con el mismo propósito. En un escenario marcado por las ejecuciones sumarias, la esclavitud de las mujeres y los bombardeos, Haibala y Malika intentarán cada uno por su lado cumplir con su misión: localizar y entregar al cabecilla de la organización fundamentalista y precipitar la caída del ISIS.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1239481","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:13.891Z"},{"id":"movie-1532997","slug":"movie-1532997","title":"Dead Howling","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eatBEEYcHQ4UmrZ79RgGqWw81IF.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1532997","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:12:14.191Z"},{"id":"movie-1106289","slug":"movie-1106289","title":"El último encargo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lbpyI9nwzSVDjS7OnE0uC41UciP.jpg","synopsis":"Una rutinaria recogida de dinero da un giro salvaje cuando dos incompatibles conductores de camión, Russell y Travis, son asaltados por despiadados criminales a las órdenes de la hábil mente maestra Zoe, cuyos planes van mucho más allá del cargamento de dinero en efectivo. Mientras el caos se desata a su alrededor, este improbable dúo tiene que enfrentarse en situaciones de alto riesgo, con personalidades que chocan continuamente y un muy mal día que no deja de empeorar.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Comedia","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1106289","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2