e todos sus planes y conviertiendo su objetivo en una alocada hazaña interestelar.  Ahora, 'Gru, mi villano favorito 2', narra una nueva aventura en la que Gru volverá a estar acompañado de simpáticos humanoides.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Familia","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/93456","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2013,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:13:40.273Z"},{"id":"movie-1769000","slug":"movie-1769000","title":"와이프","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4z0SX4YhPNm3dt1T2Q2T7hHjPKz.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1769000","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:13:40.592Z"},{"id":"movie-1477431","slug":"movie-1477431","title":"Time of Death","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gDbKETTKi8te7TiE0k6FfqAoSvR.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Terror","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1477431","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:13:40.887Z"},{"id":"movie-1555232","slug":"movie-1555232","title":"不过是上班","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ocOIxHfnxaIzrDdZRAgRnnCPS0S.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1555232","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:13:41.187Z"},{"id":"movie-420634","slug":"movie-420634","title":"Terrifier","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjXqhGmaeQpB73WerhrYU6HlyV5.jpg","synopsis":"El payaso psicópata Art, aterroriza a dos chicas durante la noche de Halloween, matando a todos aquellos que se interponen en su camino.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net