/2KLblBXNDX05ZqLwubCyjeokGvZ.jpg","synopsis":"El heredero de una fortuna, cuyo corazón artificial funciona con una batería, llega a un acuerdo con una chica electrizante para que lo recargue. ¿Surgirán chispas?","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":10,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/289423-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:15:53.688Z"},{"id":"tv-94997","slug":"tv-94997","title":"La casa del dragón","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8MaxftF69sEAAD5673vTjIl8yT3.jpg","synopsis":"Basada en el libro 'Fuego y Sangre' de George R.R. Martin. La serie se centra en la casa Targaryen, trescientos años antes de los eventos vistos en 'Juego de Tronos'.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Drama","Action & Adventure"],"totalEpisodes":26,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/94997-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2022,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:15:54.293Z"},{"id":"tv-298852","slug":"tv-298852","title":"WAR","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/df111eu7t3yAcRZLi2LO2dm3dUI.jpg","synopsis":"Una serie antológica ambientada en el elitista mundo de la abogacía londinense que sigue a dos bufetes rivales, Cathcarts y Taylor & Byrne, mientras se enfrentan en una batalla legal diferente que acapara titulares cada temporada.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":8,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/298852-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:15:55.501Z"},{"id":"tv-289080","slug":"tv-289080","title":"蒸蒸日上","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jzGDCMFErqM8Ceus8BNbyK8bzic.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":22,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/289080-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:15:56.107Z"},{"id":"tv-124364","slug"