ll,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":46,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/298629-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:21:22.872Z"},{"id":"tv-253476","slug":"tv-253476","title":"Journal with Witch","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oMgxAEq7OVvkLDevVMfYwlAzBrP.jpg","synopsis":"La novelista Makio Kodai lleva años refugiada en la soledad de su casa y en el silencio de los libros. Pero su vida da un vuelco cuando, tras la muerte de su hermana y su cuñado, se ve obligada a hacerse cargo de Asa Takumi, su sobrina de quince años. Incapaces al principio de entenderse —marcadas por el duelo, las diferencias de carácter y la convivencia forzada—, ambas comienzan poco a poco a derribar sus propias barreras. En ese proceso descubren el calor que creían perdido, la complicidad inesperada y una nueva forma de familia que nace casi sin darse cuenta.","status":"Finalizado","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":13,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/253476-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:21:23.281Z"},{"id":"tv-131040","slug":"tv-131040","title":"披荆斩棘","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hB5wJgHi7g04zcTTn92bshEKkQ4.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Reality"],"totalEpisodes":124,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/131040-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2021,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:21:23.587Z"},{"id":"tv-57775","slug":"tv-57775","title":"ちびまる子ちゃん","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/auruoMM9a9c4diotHvI5v7dKFbF.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":1694,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/57775-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":1990,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:21:23.895Z"},{"id":"tv-154770","slug":"tv-154770","title":"你好，星期六","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/